owers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/26173472","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2003#issuecomment-26173472","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2003","id":26173472,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI2MTczNDcy","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2013-10-11T21:00:31Z","updated_at":"2013-10-11T21:00:31Z","body":"30th Oct 2012, **Dan** said:\n\n---\n\nHi, thanks for your reply.\n\nI wasn't able to find any other reports of similar issues after extensive google searches, but I'm reluctant to contact Microsoft at this stage given my findings below. \n\nI've just run a test outside of cakephp but using the PDO driver, ensuring the driver works:\n\n```\ntry {\n    $dbh = new PDO(\"sqlsrv:server=$db_server;database=$db_database;\", $db_user, $db_passwd);\n    foreach($dbh->query(\"SELECT * from $db_table\") as $row) {\n        print_r($row);\n    }\n    $dbh = null;\n} catch (PDOException $e) {\n    print \"Error!: \" . $e->getMessage() . \"<br/>\";\n    die();\n}\n```\n\nThis ran perfectly and returned the results that I expected, and didn't throw a fastcgi error even after trying multiple refreshes.\n\nThanks,\nDan\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/26173472/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/26173474","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2003#issuecomment-26173474","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/2003","id":26173474,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI2MTczNDc0","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2013-10-11T21:00:32Z","updated_at":"2013-10-11T21:00:32Z","body":"30th Oct 2012, **Dan** said:\n\n---\n\nI didn't spot that I was using a persistent connection, I made it a non-persistent connection and now it's working again. \n\nI've attached a SQL trace, it seems it was closing the connection? At 16:49:50 I refreshed the page, and at 16:49:55 I refreshed again. I hope there's something in there to help resolve this, but appreciate it may be a different issue - I don't have the db knowledge to speculate. Either way I don't need to be using a persistent connection, it was only on because it defaults to true if not set.\n\nThanks,\nDan\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/26173474/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor"